### PoPunkouterSoftware — API Tests
### Run these with the REST Client extension (Ctrl+Alt+R) or JetBrains HTTP Client
### Server must be running: F5 in VS Code or `dotnet run --project PoPunkouterSoftware/PoPunkouterSoftware.csproj`
###
### This file mirrors the live route table. If you add or remove an endpoint, update it here —
### it drifted badly once before, documenting /api/diag/fix-plan, /api/diag/refresh-progress and
### an /api/health alias that no longer exist (or never did).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

# ─── Health ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /health — deep probe of all external connections (Key Vault, Table Storage)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### GET /healthz — static liveness ping, no outbound calls
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

###

### GET /diag — masked config + cache diagnostics. HTML by default; append ?format=json
GET {{baseUrl}}/diag
Accept: application/json

###

# ─── Config ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /api/config — apiBase, isMockMode, managementActionsEnabled. Nothing else, by design.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/config
Accept: application/json

###

# ─── Azure Report ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /api/diag/summary — compact first-paint contract for /azure (NOT the full graph)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diag/summary
Accept: application/json

###

### GET /api/diag/report — full report: Table Storage, then local file fallback. Supports ETag.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diag/report
Accept: application/json

###

### GET /api/diag/history — precomputed history summaries for the trend charts (max 90)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diag/history
Accept: application/json

###

### GET /api/diag/automation-script — download the Azure efficiency PowerShell script
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diag/automation-script

###

### POST /api/diag/refresh — start a background Azure rescan (202, or 409 if already running)
### Gated by ManagementActionFilter: needs FeatureFlags:EnableManagementActions=true, plus the
### X-Management-Key header when Security:ManagementApiKey is configured.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diag/refresh

###

### POST /api/diag/cancel-refresh — cancel the in-progress rescan (same gate as above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diag/cancel-refresh

###

# ─── Portfolio ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /api/portfolio — the apps.json catalog decorated with live Azure health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio
Accept: application/json

###

### GET /api/portfolio/screenshots/{host} — stored home-page screenshot for one app
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio/screenshots/popunkoutersoftware.azurewebsites.net

###

# ─── OpenAPI / Scalar ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET /openapi/v1.json — raw OpenAPI 3.x spec
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Scalar interactive UI (open in browser)
# http://localhost:8000/scalar

###
